        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Panel (kincob) of brocaded silks and silver-gilt thread on yellow silk warps. The pattern is carried out in pink, blue and black silks and silver thread on a gold ground. Three rows of Hamsa-ducks carrying sprays of flowers in their beaks within borders of angular zig zag stems of flowers and leaves."@en ;
